OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, these mainly in the west.
OL,8,FShowers easing through the afternoon
OL,9,Fleading to drier conditions later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening and
OL,12,Fnight with clear spells for most,
OL,13,Fallowing it to turn rather cold. The
OL,14,Fodd light shower around coasts not to
OL,15,Fbe ruled out.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,18,Frisk of frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,19,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,20,Fsunshine and just a few patches of
OL,21,Fcloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
